<hr id="read-marker">
The <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span> serves as the nucleus of the federal <span style="color: #007A00;">German Peasants' Party</span> and is surprisingly liberal and <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> compared to other agricultural parties and organizations, such as the <span style="color: #7FCEB1;">**CNBLP**</span>. Recently, they even exited the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span>'s cabinet over a dispute about taxes. [? if cvp_formed: <br><br> With the formation of the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span>, the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>'s Bavarian branch has largely merged into the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span>, although some elements have instead chosen to align with the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>. ?]
<hr id="read-marker">
United Left Coalition (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>[? if sapd_formed:  + <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span>?]): [+ left_coalition_bavaria +]% 

[? if traffic_coalition_bavaria > 40: Traffic Light Coalition (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] + <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span>): [+ traffic_coalition_bavaria +]% ?]

[? if traffic_coalition_bavaria < 50: Anti-<span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> Coalition (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] + <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**Z**</span> + <span style="color: #79209D;">**CSP**</span> + <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span> + <span style="color: #AFAFAF;">**Others**</span>) [+ broad_coalition_bavaria +]% ?]

[? if not kvp_formed: Bourgeois Coalition (<span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if dvp_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] + **Others**[? if not cvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>?]): [+ bourgeois_coalition_bavaria +]% ?]

[? if kvp_formed: Bourgeois Coalition (<span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if dvp_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] + **Others** + <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>): [+ bourgeois_coalition_bavaria +]% ?]

