@bvp_toleration
title: The <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> has fallen short of a majority, but continue to rule in caretaker capacity.
subtitle: Electing a new Minister-President—or dissolving the Landtag—requires an absolute majority. Deep antagonism between the opposition parties has made clearing that hurdle all but impossible.
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_bavaria < 50
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_gov = "Bourgeois"; bavaria_coalition_r = bvp_r_bavaria; bavaria_bvp = 1; bavaria_ddp = 2; bavaria_others = 2

Despite the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> falling short of a majority, even with the inclusion of other bourgeois parties, they continue to rule in as a caretaker government. [? if nsdap_bavaria_elections_vote >= 15: Negotiations with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> has collapsed, due to their disdain for Catholics. ?]

Heinrich Held, the incumbent Minister-President and a pro-democratic member of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> remains in power.

@bvp_majority
title: The <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> has captured another majority.
subtitle: As expected?
view-if: bvp_r_bavaria >= 50
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_gov = "BVP"; bavaria_coalition_r = bvp_r_bavaria; bavaria_bvp = 1

The <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> has surprisingly won an outright majority, and no longer needs the support of the bourgeois parties. This has cemented Bavaria as one of the most stable state governments, maybe not "democratic" though.

Heinrich Held, the incumbent Minister-President and a pro-democratic member of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> remains in power.

@nsdap_majority
title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> wins a majority?
subtitle: How did it come to this...?
view-if: (nsdap_r_bavaria + dnf_r_bavaria >= 50 and dnvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (nsdap_r_bavaria + dnvp_r_bavaria >= 50 and dnvp_ideology == "Radical")
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_gov = "Far-Right"; new_middle_nsdap += 6; old_middle_nsdap += 6; rural_nsdap += 6; new_middle_z -= 4; old_middle_z -= 4; rural_z -= 4; pro_republic -= 10

How the hell.

@bvp1_coalition
title: The <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> coalitions with the <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span> and various bourgeois parties.
subtitle: The <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">BVP</span> will make amends with the <span style="color: #38C538;">farmers</span>.
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_bavaria >= 50
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_gov = "Right"; bavaria_coalition_r = bourgeois_coalition_bavaria; bavaria_bvp = 1; bavaria_dbp = 1; bavaria_dnvp = 1

The former incumbent coalition consisting of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span>, <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span>, and the various smaller bourgeois parties has continued. This show of stability will weaken the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span>.

Heinrich Held, the incumbent Minister-President and a pro-democratic member of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> remains in power.

@bvp2_coalition
title: The <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> will have a Bourgeois Coalition.
subtitle: The poor performance of the DNVP has made their coalition slightly less monarchist.
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_bavaria >= 50 and dnvp_r_bavaria == 0
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_gov = "Bourgeois"; bavaria_coalition_r = bourgeois_coalition_bavaria; bavaria_bvp = 1; bavaria_ddp = 1; bavaria_dbp = 1

The former incumbent coalition consisting of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span>, <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span>, and the various smaller bourgeois parties has continued. This show of stability will weaken the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span>.

Heinrich Held, the incumbent Minister-President and a pro-democratic member of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> remains in power.

@spd_majority
title: The <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> forms a majority government.
subtitle: Congratulations.
view-if: spd_r_bavaria >= 50
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_gov = "SPD"; bavaria_coalition_r = spd_r_bavaria; bavaria_spp = 1
achievement: rotes_bayern

We have somehow managed to capture a majority in the Landtag, and have put our Minister-President as the head of the most conservative state in the country. Hopefully this doesn't end badly like last time. Bavaria has been governed by the political right ever since 1921, and the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> has often covered for reactionary political activity. Now, we are able to change that and aggressively counter the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> thugs roaming the streets [? if sa_nationwide_ban: and more aggressively enforce the national ban of the organization that the conservative Held government had mostly ignored ?].

@traffic_coalition
title: The <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> will form a coalition government with the bourgeois parties.
view-if: traffic_coalition_bavaria > 40
subtitle: The <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span> had a falling out right? Let's utilize our contacts with their left wing. -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: [? if traffic_coalition_bavaria < 50: <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">LVP</span>?] + <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span> ([+ traffic_coalition_bavaria +]%)  ?][? if resources < 1: - Not enough resources (need 1). ?]
choose-if: traffic_coalition_bavaria >= 50 and resources >= 1
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; resources -= 1; bavaria_gov = "Traffic"; bavaria_coalition_r = traffic_coalition_bavaria; bavaria_spd = 1; bavaria_ddp = 1; bavaria_dbp = 1
achievement: ampelkoalition

Somehow, we have brought the [? if not lvp_formed and ddp_r_bavaria: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> and?][? if lvp_formed and lvp_r_bavaria: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span> and?] <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span> to the negotiating table, despite their preference for working with the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span>. Through connections with the left-wing and liberal factions within the <span style="color: #38C538;">Bavarian Peasants’ League</span>, we have overcome their reluctance—and now, we are in government! Bavaria has been governed by the political right ever since 1921, and the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span> has often covered for reactionary political activity. Now, we are able to change that and counter the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> thugs roaming the streets [? if sa_nationwide_ban: and more aggressively enforce the national ban of the organization that the conservative Held government had mostly ignored ?].


@united_left
title: The <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> will form a coalition government with the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>?
subtitle: History will repeat itself.
view-if: left_coalition_bavaria >= 50 and (kpd_relation >= 60 and kpd_leader == "Conciliators") or (kpd_relation >= 80 and kpd_leader != "Conciliators")
on-arrival: bavaria_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; bavaria_spd = 1; bavaria_gov = "Left"; z_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 5; dvp_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 5; coup_progress += 10; bavaria_coalition_r = left_coalition_bavaria; bavaria_spd = 1; bavaria_sapd = 1; bavaria_kpd = 1; bavaria_uspd = 1

The conservative stronghold of the republic, home to the largest concentration of Catholics and general forces of <span style="color: #808080;">reaction</span> has finally fallen to the forces of the <span style="color: #700000;">Left</span>. Few could have expected the seeds of <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span>, much less <span style="color: #700000;">communism</span> to once again take root in Bavaria, but the election results showed have made this impossibility into a living nightmare for the right. <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Stahlhelm**</span> brigands, along with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> are already rushing to prepare a coup against what they see as a <span style="color: #700000;">communist</span> takeover in progress, and we may soon have a civil war on our hands.
The legacy of the Bavarian Worker’s Republic has been avenged, but at what cost?

@bavaria_coalition_creator_option
title: Custom Coalition Creator
subtitle: Some options micht be a little unorthodox...
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = spd_r_bavaria; bavaria_spd = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_coalition_creator
title: Coalition Creator

Current support: [+ bavaria_coalition_r +]%

- @bavaria_invite_kpd: Invite the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_sapd: Invite the <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_uspd: Invite the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_csp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ other_colour +];">**CSP**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_ddp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_z: Invite the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">Center Party</span>
- @bavaria_invite_dbp: Invite the <span style="color: #226510;">**[+ dbp_name +]</span>
- @bavaria_invite_others: Invite the <span style="color: [+ other_colour +];">**Others**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_bvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ bvp_colour +];">**BVP**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_dvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_wp: Invite the <span style="color: #b8996f;">**WP**</span>
- @bavaria_invite_dnvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**BMP**</span>
- @bavaria_check_out: Check out.
- @bavaria_drop_kpd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_sapd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_uspd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_csp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ other_colour +];">**CSP**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_ddp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_z: Drop the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">Center Party</span>
- @bavaria_drop_dbp: Drop the <span style="color: #226510;">**[+ dbp_name +]</span>
- @bavaria_drop_others: Drop the <span style="color: [+ other_colour +];">**Others**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_bvp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ bvp_colour +];">**BVP**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_dvp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>
- @bavaria_drop_wp: Drop the <span style="color: #b8996f;">**WP**</span>
- @return_to_baden: Return


@bavaria_invite_kpd
view-if: kpd_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_kpd = 1
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 65 and bavaria_dvp == 0 and bavaria_wp == 0 and (not bavaria_z == 1 or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Kaiser")
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> will demand radical policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  kpd_relation < 65: We need better relations. ?][? if not bavaria_dvp == 0: They are not really pleased about our partners. ?]
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + kpd_r_bavaria; bavaria_kpd = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_sapd
view-if: sapd_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_sapd = 1
choose-if: sapd_relation >= 60 and bavaria_dvp == 0 and bavaria_wp == 0 and (not bavaria_z == 1 or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Kaiser")
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span> will demand radical policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  sapd_relation < 60: We need better relations. ?][? if not bavaria_dvp == 0: They are not really pleased about our partners. ?]
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + sapd_r_bavaria; bavaria_sapd = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_uspd
view-if: uspd_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_uspd = 1
choose-if: uspd_relation >= 50 and bavaria_wp == 0 and (not bavaria_z == 1 or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Kaiser" or uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism")
subtitle: [? if not uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": The <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span> will demand radical policies. ?][? if uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": Center Marxists are flexible. ?]
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + uspd_r_bavaria; bavaria_uspd = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_ddp
view-if: ddp_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_ddp = 1
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 45 and (not bavaria_kpd == 1 or kpd_leader == "Conciliators")
subtitle: [? if ddp_relation >= 65: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> loves you! ?]
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + ddp_r_bavaria; bavaria_ddp = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_csp
view-if: csp_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_csp = 1
choose-if: z_relation >= 30
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + csp_r_bavaria; bavaria_csp = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_dbp
view-if: farm_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_dbp = 1
choose-if: z_relation >= 35 and (not bavaria_kpd == 1 or kpd_leader == "Conciliators")
subtitle: This is an Agrarian Party, you know what they want?
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + farm_r_bavaria; bavaria_dbp = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_z
view-if: true_z_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_z = 1
choose-if: z_relation >= 30 and (not bavaria_kpd == 1 or kpd_leader == "Conciliators")
subtitle: Honestly, what are they going to demand?
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + true_z_r_bavaria; bavaria_z = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_dvp
view-if: dvp_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_dvp = 1
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 67 and bavaria_kpd == 0 and bavaria_sapd == 0
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span> demands tax cuts.
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + dvp_r_bavaria; bavaria_dvp = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_bvp
view-if: bvp_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_dvp = 1
choose-if: bvp_relation >= 55 and bavaria_kpd == 0 and bavaria_sapd == 0
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ bvp_colour +];">**BVP**</span> demands no change in established policy
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + dvp_r_bavaria; bavaria_dvp = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_others
view-if: true_other_r_bavaria > 0 and not bavaria_true_others = 1
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 40 and z_relation >= 67
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ other_colour +];">**Others**</span> are a little conservative.
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r + true_other_r_bavaria; bavaria_true_others = 1
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_invite_dnvp
view-if: dnvp_r_bavaria > 0
choose-if: dnvp_relation >= 900
subtitle: This won't happen.
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

Why are you so desperate?

@bavaria_check_out
choose-if: bavaria_coalition_r >= 50
subtitle: We can form a coalition!
unavailable-subtitle: We need more partners
on-arrival: bavaria_gov = "Social-Catholic" if bavaria_spd == 1 and bavaria_z == 1; bavaria_gov = "Weimar" if bavaria_spd == 1 and bavaria_z == 1 and bavaria_ddp == 1; bavaria_gov = "Grand" if bavaria_spd == 1 and bavaria_z == 1 and bavaria_dvp == 1; bavaria_gov = "Left" if bavaria_spd == 1 and bavaria_kpd == 1; bavaria_gov = "Popular-Front" if bavaria_spd == 1 and bavaria_z == 1 and bavaria_kpd == 1; bavaria_gov = "Social-Democratic" if bavaria_uspd == 1 and not bavaria_kpd == 1 and not bavaria_z == 1; bavaria_gov = "Social-Liberal" if bavaria_ddp == 1 and not bavaria_z == 1 and bavaria_spd == 1  

Congrats you have formed a [+ bavaria_gov +] Coalition with [+ bavaria_coalition_r +]% parliamentary support!

@bavaria_drop_kpd
view-if: bavaria_kpd = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - kpd_r_bavaria; bavaria_kpd = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_sapd
view-if: bavaria_sapd = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - sapd_r_bavaria; bavaria_sapd = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_uspd
view-if: bavaria_uspd = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - uspd_r_bavaria; bavaria_uspd = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_ddp
view-if: bavaria_ddp = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - ddp_r_bavaria; bavaria_ddp = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_csp
view-if: bavaria_csp = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - csp_r_bavaria; bavaria_csp = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_dbp
view-if: bavaria_dbp = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - farm_r_bavaria; bavaria_dbp = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_z
view-if: bavaria_z = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - true_z_r_bavaria; bavaria_z = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_dvp
view-if: bavaria_dvp = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - dvp_r_bavaria; bavaria_dvp = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_bvp
view-if: bavaria_bvp = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - bvp_r_bavaria; bavaria_bvp = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator

@bavaria_drop_others
view-if: bavaria_true_others = 1
on-arrival: bavaria_coalition_r = bavaria_coalition_r - true_other_r_bavaria; bavaria_true_others = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_creator



@return_to_bavaria
on-arrival: bavaria_spd = 0; bavaria_kpd = 0; bavaria_sapd = 0; bavaria_uspd = 0; bavaria_ddp = 0; bavaria_z = 0; bavaria_dvp = 0; bavaria_true_others = 0; bavaria_lvp = 0; bavaria_wp = 0
go-to: bavaria_coalition_menu


